    "rating": 3,
    "reference": "ChIJJ9O8IpY3yUwRl4SJz3k8404",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Olivier Brochu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117450954606085114085/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUF7EwAYGYEseiAqpaJPam6_7arW068vt3oleuFGJSOWMRhnG33yA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I rarely leave reviews, but this clinic has been consistently disappointing. The wait times just to speak to someone are unreal. Their website always shows zero availability, whether you need a regular appointment or something urgent. Calling isn't any better.The phone system keeps saying you’re “next in line” with an estimated 9-minute wait, but it repeats for over an hour with no answer.\n\nThey have also messed up my appointments and paperwork more than once, and when you finally do reach someone, you're often told there isn’t much they can do even for urgent medical issues. For a medical office, the lack of reliability and organization is concerning. Patients deserve better.\nIt's too bad because my family Doctor is great. The office part of things , not so much.",
        "time": 1760293078,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christ St-Yves",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105592753415039491867/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKnQzWy6BvEjq5tf4rNE7_yZsMnxEFQPISFZRJZV_9nUyUEGw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Try calling.... No one ever answers, busy for hours or when you call again, was supposed to be next with about 4 minutes wait, hung up after over half hour wait. Called again to try to cancel an appointment, can't reach anyone. How can you cancel on time if they don't answer. And if you try online, you have to choose the person you have an appointment with but they are not listed! Awful system! I guess they are trying to find a way to charge you a cancellation fee.",
        "time": 1757953631,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Davide Ritarose",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108070071060804342361/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXp9wox1fCNmpk_ZD8_mETIJzJiG_GhoFbyI8tP27WbzuVE55pQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Who ever is in charge of HR (Human Resources) needs a GOLD STAR. (because they hired a person named KRIS)\nWHY!! Because I was there Oct 26 2025 at the Clinique and while waiting for the Stand by Doctor to see me I heard this fantastic employee answering the phone talking to different people. He spoke either in French or English helping those on the phone and I did with class and very professionally, polite and able to demission their fears even those who were not able to get an appointment.  Davide Ritarose",
        "time": 1761523304,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kera Bridgman-Ibrahim",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114903330029795288320/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocICq8yrQkx012ERShGlSkyVkuJobtop6tLKI-Dyii9kiLbhug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The secretarial staff is impossible to deal with. I was passed around to 4 different people, just to be put on hold again and again. I was hung up on twice. When I asked who I was speaking to the woman on the other end yelled at me for asking for her name. I called back again the next day because I never received an answer to my original question, left a message and am still waiting for a call back. That was 2 weeks ago. Pathetic customer service.",
        "time": 1759266431,
        "translated": false
      },
